<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Terms of Service - Boston Web3 Meetup</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@400;600;700&family=Open+Sans:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style is:inline>
    :root {
      --navy: #0C2340;
      --red: #BD3039;
      --gold: #C8A951;
      --white: #F5F5F5;
      --text: #1a1a1a;
      --text-light: #555;
    }

    *, *::before, *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Open Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--white);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    h1, h2, h3 {
      font-family: 'Oswald', system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .terms-header {
      background: var(--navy);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .terms-header h1 {
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }

    .terms-header p {
      opacity: 0.8;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .terms-content {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    }

    .terms-content h2 {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      color: var(--navy);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
      padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--red);
    }

    .terms-content h2:first-child {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .terms-content p {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .terms-content ul {
      margin: 0 0 1rem 1.5rem;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .terms-content li {
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    .terms-content a {
      color: var(--red);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .terms-content a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .back-link {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--navy);
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 2px solid var(--navy);
      padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;
    }

    .back-link:hover {
      background: var(--navy);
      color: #fff;
    }

    footer {
      background: var(--navy);
      color: #ccc;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    footer strong {
      color: #fff;
      font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    footer a {
      color: var(--gold);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    footer a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="terms-header">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p>Boston Web3 Meetup at Fenway Park</p>
  </div>

  <div class="terms-content">
    <h2>Purpose of Data Collection</h2>
    <p>This website is operated by the organizers of the Boston Web3 Meetup at Fenway Park. The interest form on this site collects limited personal information solely for the purpose of gauging interest and coordinating logistics for this event.</p>

    <h2>What We Collect</h2>
    <p>When you submit the interest form, we may collect:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your name</li>
      <li>Your X (Twitter) handle or email address</li>
      <li>Your preferred game series, date, and reception package</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not collect payment information, passwords, or any other sensitive data through this form.</p>

    <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>Your information is used exclusively to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Gauge community interest in the event</li>
      <li>Coordinate group size and logistics with the venue</li>
      <li>Send you updates about the event as plans come together</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We will not sell, share, or distribute your information to third parties for marketing or any other purpose unrelated to this event.</p>

    <h2>Data Retention &amp; Deletion</h2>
    <p>All personal information collected through this form will be permanently deleted after the event has concluded. We do not retain your data beyond what is needed to organize this meetup.</p>
    <p>If you would like your information deleted at any time before or after the event, you may reach out to the event organizers on X (Twitter) at <a href="https://x.com/T1MLivingston" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@T1MLivingston</a> and we will promptly remove your data.</p>

    <h2>Data Storage</h2>
    <p>Form submissions are stored in a private Google Sheets document accessible only to the event organizers. The data is transmitted securely via Google Apps Script.</p>

    <h2>No Account Required</h2>
    <p>This site does not require you to create an account. There are no cookies used for tracking. The form is entirely optional.</p>

    <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms if the scope of the event changes. Any significant changes will be communicated through the same channels used to share event updates.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For any questions about these terms or to request data deletion, please reach out to the event organizers on X:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://x.com/T1MLivingston" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@T1MLivingston</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://x.com/Teacher96_Katie" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@Teacher96_Katie</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://x.com/montanakind" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@montanakind</a></li>
    </ul>

    <a href="https://livingbots.io/boston" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Event Page</a>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <strong>Fenway Park &bull; Boston, MA</strong>
    <p>4 Jersey Street, Boston, MA 02215</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
